[118.257233, "o", "  Quick check, using July's actual numbers (closed, all 18 transactions categorized) and August's draft plan:\r\n\r\n  - **Category fit**: no existing category covers a one-off appliance — closest is a \"want\" outside subscriptions/dining_out/groceries/car. Awareness mode has no caps here to bump against.\r\n  - **This month (July, closed)**: income €2,800, spend €874.46 (car €505.04 incl. €420 insurance, groceries €309.14, dining €36.32, subscriptions €23.96) → surplus €1,925.54. €340 would've still left €1,585.54 over.\r\n  - **Next month (August, drafted)**: projected surplus €2,157.55 (income €2,800 − planned €642.45). Taking the €340 out of that leaves €1,817.55 — still comfortably positive.\r\n  - **Buffer goal**: target is €1,503.96. Either month's surplus alone clears that with room to spare, €340 included — this purchase doesn't put the buffer goal at risk in any real sense.\r\n\r\n  Options, not a verdict: buy it now against July's already-closed surplus, buy it in August against the draft plan, or just not think about the timing at all since neither month's numbers are tight enough for it to matter.\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;36malex ▸ \u001b[0m"]
